      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASKERN VIOLET (4) was quickly into stride and found the front last start to record an all-the-way win (25.08) at this track in a Grade 5 H over 450m. Hard to knock her form from this box, unbeaten in three starts. In sparkling form with a string of wins and can measure up again. KEN KANEKI (1) is a super consistent dog who rarely misses the frame, last start scoring at this track (25.15), making it three straight wins. Solid record at this trip including six wins. Has a good overall strike-rate and can find the frame here. DRAX BALE (2) is a smart beginner who has shown good improvement at his last two starts, breaking through last time at this track over 450m. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. PAW NILBERT (7) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a 0.8 lengths second (25.20) in a Grade 5 H at this track.",
